WEBVTT

00:00:00.291 --> 00:00:04.916
This cocktail is called Boat Drink.

00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:07.416
Go ahead and start off with putting your ice in your glass.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:11.791
Then we're going to do two ounces of spiced Rum.

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:13.666
Now this is Captain Morgan.

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:15.666
But there are a lot of spiced Rums, out there.

00:00:15.208 --> 00:00:17.083
What is the one?

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:17.791
Oh!

00:00:16.833 --> 00:00:19.125
Sailor Jerry's.

00:00:18.208 --> 00:00:20.666
they make a good spiced Rum.

00:00:19.916 --> 00:00:23.083
And it has a tint of a cherry flavor.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:31.166
So if you like your spiced Rum a little bit sweet.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:01:02.958
And you are on your way.

00:01:05.666 --> 00:01:15.875
Cheers!
